1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,270
Now let's connect your scan to the correct REPro
shoot.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:08,115
Once the order is in Draft, open the CubiCasa app with
an account that can access your team's

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:10,410
orders. Open Orders and choose Draft.

4
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:15,570
Find your property and check the address against the
assigned shoot.

5
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:18,830
Check the shoot ID when shown, then open the matching
draft.

6
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:24,015
If the order is missing or incorrect, contact the
REPro team before creating another

7
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:24,430
order.

8
00:00:25,347 --> 00:00:29,802
For a new scan, start from that draft order and follow
the scanning instructions you just

9
00:00:29,807 --> 00:00:34,102
watched. Cover the full property, then review your
scan and the app's feedback before

10
00:00:34,107 --> 00:00:34,657
continuing.

11
00:00:35,713 --> 00:00:39,843
If you've already captured the property, open its
draft and choose Attach Scan.

12
00:00:40,193 --> 00:00:42,443
Select the matching scan saved on this phone.

13
00:00:42,593 --> 00:00:45,063
Check carefully that the scan belongs to this address.

14
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:48,110
Review the address and order details.

15
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,550
The package is already selected on the draft.

16
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:55,755
When everything is correct, choose Send for Processing
and complete any confirmation shown in

17
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:56,190
the app.

18
00:00:57,180 --> 00:01:01,230
Use a stable internet connection and keep the app open
until the upload finishes.

19
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:04,150
If it fails, check the connection and retry.

20
00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:06,930
Confirm the order has moved out of Draft before
leaving.

21
00:01:07,947 --> 00:01:10,317
CubiCasa processes the submitted scan.

22
00:01:10,647 --> 00:01:15,137
Once the order is ready, REPro can sync the finished
floor plans to the linked shoot.

23
00:01:15,367 --> 00:01:19,157
Check the shoot in REPro, and contact the team if the
plans are missing.

24
00:01:19,467 --> 00:01:23,277
Remember: match the draft, scan or attach, then
submit.

